# 将本文件复制到不受 Git 跟踪的秘密配置源；不得提交真实数据库凭据、私钥、
# 一次性启动码或运营商配置。
# English: Copy this file to a secret configuration source that is not tracked by Git; no real database
# credentials, private keys, One-time activation code or carrier configuration.

# 以下变量名由 server/internal/platform/config.go 精确读取。
# English: The following variable names are read exactly by server/internal/platform/config.go.
RGS_ENVIRONMENT=production
RGS_HTTP_ADDR=:8080
# 运维探针必须使用独立的回环或私网监听器。生产环境会拒绝与 RGS_HTTP_ADDR 冲突的
# 地址；不得通过公网 RGS 入口发布此端口。
# English: operations probes must use independent loopback or private listeners. artifactsion environments will
# reject content that conflicts with RGS_HTTP_ADDR Address; this port must not be published through the public
# RGS entrance.
RGS_OPERATIONS_HTTP_ADDR=127.0.0.1:8081
# 生产环境以及运维监听器不是回环地址时，/readyz 与 /metrics 必须使用该令牌。
# 应挂载普通秘密文件，不得把令牌值放入环境变量。文件内容至少 16 字节且不含空白；
# 文件不得可执行、组可写或对其他用户开放，通常使用 0600，专用秘密组可使用 0640。
# English: In the artifactsion environment and when the operations listener is not a loopback address, /readyz
# and /metrics must use this token. Normal secret files should be mounted and token values must not be put into
# environment variables. The file content must be at least 16 bytes without whitespace; The file must not be
# executable, group writable, or open to other users, typically use 0600, private secret groups can use 0640.
RGS_OPERATIONS_BEARER_TOKEN_FILE=/run/rgs-secrets/operations-bearer.token
RGS_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://rgs.example.com
# 运行时只能获得具备 DML 权限的凭据，不得向 rgs-server 注入迁移器 DSN。生产环境要求
# 此地址恰好包含一个 sslmode=verify-full 查询参数，否则拒绝启动。
# English: Only credentials with DML permissions can be obtained at runtime and the migrator DSN must not be
# injected into rgs-server. artifactsion environment requirements This address happens to contain an
# sslmode=verify-full query parameter, otherwise startup is refused.
RGS_DATABASE_URL=postgres://rgs_runtime:REPLACE_WITH_RUNTIME_SECRET@postgres.example.internal:5432/rgs?sslmode=verify-full
# 每个 RGS 副本的 PostgreSQL 连接池预算。所有副本总和不得超过已批准的数据库连接预算；
# 最大连接范围为 1..200，最大空闲连接范围为 0..最大连接数。
# English: PostgreSQL connection pool budget per RGS replica. The sum of all replicas must not exceed the
# approved database connection budget; The maximum connection range is 1..200, and the maximum idle connection
# range is 0..Maximum connections.
RGS_DB_MAX_OPEN_CONNS=40
RGS_DB_MAX_IDLE_CONNS=10
# API 为 status、pending result、ACK 和 refresh 保留的同池保守连接预算；必须在
# 1..RGS_DB_MAX_OPEN_CONNS-1 内。新 launch/spin 达到该上界时在经济事务前失败关闭。
# English: Same-pool conservative connection budget reserved by the API for status, pending result, ACK, and
# refresh; must be within 1..RGS_DB_MAX_OPEN_CONNS-1. New launch/spins that reach this upper bound fail to shut
# down before economic transactions.
RGS_DB_CRITICAL_RESERVE_CONNS=5
RGS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://casino.example.com,https://m.casino.example.com

# 仅当可信反向代理终止公网 TLS，且不可信网络无法访问 RGS 监听器时才设为 true；
# 其他情况必须挂载证书和私钥文件。
# English: Set to true only if the trusted reverse proxy terminates public TLS and the RGS listener is
# unreachable by the untrusted network; In other cases, the certificate and private key files must be mounted.
RGS_TLS_TERMINATED_UPSTREAM=true
RGS_TLS_CERT_FILE=
RGS_TLS_KEY_FILE=

# 以下配置与秘密均以只读方式挂载。RGS_DEFINITION_FILE 是精确数学定义 JSON。生产环境
# 要求独立签署的 rgs-definition-approval-v2 信封绑定相同的游戏、版本与哈希，并提供
# 非空的外部数学报告、随机数报告和辖区批准引用。运行时只验证签名和引用身份，不替代
# 外部材料本身的认证。信任锚公钥必须独立管控和挂载，禁止使用带演示标记的身份。
# English: The following configurations and secrets are mounted read-only. RGS_DEFINITION_FILE is the exact
# mathematical definition JSON. artifactsion environment Require independently signed rgs-definition-approval-v2
# envelopes bound to the same game, version and hash, and provide Non-empty external math reports, random number
# reports, and jurisdiction approval references. Only the signature and reference identity are verified at
# runtime, not replaced. Certification of the exterior assets itself. The trust anchor public key must be
# independently controlled and mounted, and the use of demo-tagged identities is prohibited.
RGS_OPERATOR_CONFIG_FILE=/run/rgs-config/operators.json
RGS_DEFINITION_FILE=/run/rgs-config/game-definition.json
RGS_DEFINITION_APPROVAL_FILE=/run/rgs-config/game-definition-approval.json
RGS_DEFINITION_APPROVAL_PUBLIC_KEY_FILE=/run/rgs-config/definition-approval-public.pem
RGS_LAUNCH_HMAC_KEY_FILE=/run/rgs-secrets/launch-hmac.key

# 生产环境必须配置。该地址属于可信部署配置，并须实现 docs/outbox-delivery.md 契约。
# HMAC 文件必须是恰好 32 个独立随机字节的标准 Base64。Bearer 与双向 TLS 可作为附加
# 身份和通道控制；不得把任何凭据写入地址。
# English: The artifactsion environment must be configured. This address belongs to the trusted deployment
# configuration and must implement the docs/outbox-delivery.md contract. HMAC files must be standard Base64 of
# exactly 32 independent random bytes. Bearer and mutual TLS are available as add-ons Identity and channel
# control; no credentials may be written to the address.
RGS_OUTBOX_ENDPOINT_URL=https://audit.example.internal/rgs/v1/events
RGS_OUTBOX_HMAC_KEY_ID=audit-2026-01
RGS_OUTBOX_HMAC_KEY_FILE=/run/rgs-secrets/outbox-hmac.key
RGS_OUTBOX_BEARER_TOKEN_FILE=
RGS_OUTBOX_ROOT_CA_FILE=/run/rgs-config/audit-root-ca.pem
RGS_OUTBOX_CLIENT_CERT_FILE=
RGS_OUTBOX_CLIENT_KEY_FILE=
# 留空时为每个进程生成密码学安全的随机所有者标识。
# English: When left blank generates a cryptographically secure random owner ID for each process.
RGS_OUTBOX_OWNER=

# Go 时长字符串。保持请求头读取时限 <= 请求读取时限 <= 业务请求时限 < 响应写入时限。
# 启动凭据和访问凭据的硬上限分别为 5 分钟与 1 小时。
# English: Go duration string. Keep request header reading time limit <= request reading time limit <= business
# request time limit < response writing time limit. Hard caps for launch credentials and access credentials are
# 5 minutes and 1 hour respectively.
RGS_READ_HEADER_TIMEOUT=5s
RGS_READ_TIMEOUT=15s
# 端到端业务处理时限必须短于响应写入时限，并长于 PostgreSQL 语句时限和钱包时限。
# English: The end-to-end business processing time limit must be shorter than the response write time limit, and
# longer than the PostgreSQL statement time limit and wallet time limit.
RGS_REQUEST_TIMEOUT=15s
RGS_WRITE_TIMEOUT=20s
RGS_IDLE_TIMEOUT=60s
RGS_SHUTDOWN_TIMEOUT=20s
# 以下参数会作为 PostgreSQL 启动参数应用到每个运行时连接。锁等待时限不得超过语句
# 执行时限，且两者都必须能表示为整数毫秒。
# English: The following parameters are applied to each runtime connection as PostgreSQL startup parameters. The
# lock waiting time limit must not exceed the statement Execution time limit, and both must be expressible as
# integer milliseconds.
RGS_DB_STATEMENT_TIMEOUT=10s
RGS_DB_LOCK_TIMEOUT=2s
RGS_WALLET_TIMEOUT=4s
# 已持久化 PREPARED 后同步等待钱包的有界快路径；必须大于 0 且短于 RGS_WALLET_TIMEOUT。
# 超过该时间返回可恢复 pending，由同一 operation ID 的持久调度继续，不重跑 RNG。
# English: Bounded fast path for the wallet to wait for after PREPARED has been persisted; must be greater than
# 0 and shorter than RGS_WALLET_TIMEOUT. Recoverable pending is returned after this time, and the persistent
# scheduling of the same operation ID is continued without re-running the RNG.
RGS_WALLET_FAST_PATH_TIMEOUT=1s
RGS_WALLET_MAX_ATTEMPTS=100
RGS_LAUNCH_TTL=2m
RGS_ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL=15m

# 审计投递采用带围栏的至少一次语义。租约时长必须大于“发布时限 ×
# 向上取整（批量大小 / 最大并行数）”。
# English: Audit delivery uses fenced at-least-once semantics. The lease duration must be greater than the
# "release time limit × Round up (batch size / max parallelism)".
RGS_OUTBOX_INTERVAL=1s
RGS_OUTBOX_LEASE_DURATION=3m
RGS_OUTBOX_PUBLISH_TIMEOUT=10s
RGS_OUTBOX_BATCH_SIZE=100
RGS_OUTBOX_MAX_PARALLEL=8
RGS_OUTBOX_INITIAL_BACKOFF=1s
RGS_OUTBOX_MAXIMUM_BACKOFF=5m
RGS_OUTBOX_WORKER_MAX_STALENESS=4m
RGS_OUTBOX_BACKLOG_MAX_AGE=5m

# 以下为单实例准入控制；边缘与分布式控制仍须保留。8 KiB 是 ALB WAF 能完整
# 检查的固定正文窗口，也是当前全部合法业务 JSON 的严格应用硬上限，不得放宽。
# English: The following are single-instance admission controls; edge and distributed controls must still be
# retained. 8 KiB is the ALB WAF that can complete The fixed text window for inspection is also the current
# strict application hard limit for all legal business JSON and cannot be relaxed.
RGS_MAX_REQUEST_BYTES=8192
# 全进程公网请求采用非阻塞预算，并在签名、令牌和数据库工作前执行；公网不提供
# /healthz 匿名旁路，存活探针只走私有 operations 监听器。有效范围为 1..4096。
# English: Full-process public requests use non-blocking budgets and are executed before signature, token and
# database work; public does not provide /healthz Anonymous bypass, the survival probe only has the operations
# listener. The valid range is 1..4096.
RGS_MAX_IN_FLIGHT_REQUESTS=256
# Ed25519 验签/签名使用独立 CPU bulkhead。未认证 method/path 不得取得额外预留，
# 否则攻击者可伪造状态或 ACK 路径占满所谓恢复容量。
# English: Ed25519 Verification/signing uses independent CPU bulkhead. Uncertified method/path shall not obtain
# additional reservations, Otherwise an attacker can spoof the status or ACK path to fill the so-called recovery
# capacity.
RGS_MAX_CRYPTO_IN_FLIGHT=64
# 每个公网/运维监听器的已接受连接硬上限；覆盖慢请求头、悬挂请求正文、
# TLS 握手与空闲 keep-alive。每个副本按 fd/内存预算设置，范围 1..16384。
# English: Hard upper limit of accepted connections for each public/operations listener; covers slow request
# headers, hanging request bodies, TLS handshake and idle keep-alive. Each replica is set by fd/memory budget,
# range 1..16384.
RGS_MAX_CONNECTIONS_PER_LISTENER=1024
# 签名和令牌验证前的进程级固定高水位，不读取 RemoteAddr/XFF/声明身份；正常业务
# 精确配额仍由认证后本机桶与 Valkey 共享准入执行。
# English: Process-level fixed high-water mark before signature and token verification, does not read
# RemoteAddr/XFF/claim identity; normal business Precise quotas are still enforced by shared admission between
# the local bucket and Valkey after authentication.
RGS_PREAUTH_RATE_PER_SECOND=5000
RGS_PREAUTH_RATE_BURST=10000
# 已签名的运营商调用按通过验证的运营商限流；浏览器调用按通过验证的运营商与会话组合
# 限流。代理或客户端 IP 请求头永远不得作为限流键。
# English: Signed operator calls are limited based on the verified operator; browser calls are based on the
# verified operator and session combination. Current limiting. Proxy or client IP request headers must never be
# used as throttling keys.
RGS_RATE_PER_SECOND=20
RGS_RATE_BURST=40

# 生产 API 必须使用 rediss + 专用 ACL + 文件秘密。普通共享桶保护 launch；Spin 改由
# 单次原子 operator/backend 双成本桶保护。任何 Valkey/协议/静态路由故障都在钱包和
# RNG 前失败关闭；status、pending result、ACK 与 Worker 恢复不依赖该成本桶。
# English: artifactsion API must use rediss + private ACL + file secret. Ordinary shared bucket protection
# launch; Spin changed to Single-shot atomic operator/backend double-cost bucket protection. Any
# Valkey/protocol/static route failures are in the wallet and Failed to close before RNG; status, pending
# result, ACK and Worker recovery do not depend on this cost bucket.
RGS_SHARED_ADMISSION_URL=rediss://valkey.example.internal:6379
RGS_SHARED_ADMISSION_USERNAME=rgs-api
RGS_SHARED_ADMISSION_PASSWORD_FILE=/run/rgs-secrets/valkey-password
RGS_SHARED_ADMISSION_HMAC_KEY_FILE=/run/rgs-secrets/admission-hmac.key
RGS_SHARED_ADMISSION_ROOT_CA_FILE=/run/rgs-config/valkey-root.pem
RGS_SHARED_ADMISSION_TIMEOUT=100ms
RGS_SHARED_ADMISSION_RATE_PER_SECOND=500
RGS_SHARED_ADMISSION_RATE_BURST=1000
# 这些值是本平台 EDoS 防御上限，不代表真实供应商配额。上线前必须按每个钱包合同、
# 429/计费语义和故障压测结果审批；当前 Spin 固定 costUnits=1，不按 bet 金额猜测成本。
# English: These values are the EDoS defense upper limits of this platform and do not represent real supplier
# quotas. Before going online, you must press each wallet contract, 429/Approval of billing semantics and fault
# stress test results; the current Spin fixed costUnits=1, and does not guess the cost based on the bet amount.
RGS_ECONOMIC_OPERATOR_RATE_PER_SECOND=20
RGS_ECONOMIC_OPERATOR_RATE_BURST=40
RGS_ECONOMIC_BACKEND_RATE_PER_SECOND=100
RGS_ECONOMIC_BACKEND_RATE_BURST=200

# 以下变量配置 deploy/docker-compose.postgres.yml，而不是 Go 应用。
# English: The following variables configure deploy/docker-compose.postgres.yml, not the Go application.
POSTGRES_DB=rgs
POSTGRES_USER=rgs
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=REPLACE_WITH_UNTRACKED_SECRET
RGS_MIGRATOR_PASSWORD=REPLACE_WITH_UNTRACKED_MIGRATOR_SECRET
RGS_RUNTIME_PASSWORD=REPLACE_WITH_UNTRACKED_RUNTIME_SECRET
POSTGRES_BIND_ADDRESS=127.0.0.1
POSTGRES_PORT=5432

# 以下变量只供一次性 rgs-migrator 任务使用，不得注入 rgs-server。
# English: The following variables are only used by the one-time rgs-migrator task and must not be injected into
# rgs-server.
RGS_MIGRATOR_DATABASE_URL=postgres://rgs_migrator:REPLACE_WITH_MIGRATOR_SECRET@postgres.example.internal:5432/rgs?sslmode=verify-full
RGS_RUNTIME_DATABASE_ROLE=rgs_runtime
RGS_MIGRATION_TIMEOUT=2m
